# STATUS — where the build is

> Read `CLAUDE.md` first (working rules), then `PHASE_PLAN.md` (the phases), then this.
> Design authority: `Foundational Research/design/00_SPINE.md` (D1–D13).
> Living record: `wiki/`.
>
> **Last updated:** 2026-08-15 — Phase 1 in flight.

---

## The pivot, in one paragraph

Walnut is now **general AI + agent infrastructure (Track A)**. Healthcare is one domain **pack**,
a peer of finance and government; the engine must know no domain by name. The thing being sold is
the **evidence substrate**: every value carries a re-executable proof of where it came from, and
anything without one is refused at construction. The graph, the adapter fleet and the materialiser
are how that is delivered — not what is sold, because each is independently commoditised as of
Aug 2026 (see spine §1).

